# {{brandName}}

This Karsa site was generated by `create-karsa`.

## Start developing

```sh
bun install
bun run cf-typegen
bun run db:sync
bun run db:migrate:local
bun run dev
```

The local app uses Wrangler's D1 and R2 emulators. Add real Cloudflare resources only when
you are ready to deploy. See `AGENTS.md` for the project rules that coding agents should
follow.

## Build with AI

Karsa installs reusable skills for Codex, Claude, and Cursor in `.agents/skills/` and
`.claude/skills/`. Ask an AI coding agent to inspect `AGENTS.md` first, for example:

> Bangun situs company untuk bisnis kopi lokal ini. Mulai dengan rencana, pilih tier yang
> disetujui, gunakan workflow Karsa yang tersedia, lalu implementasikan dan jalankan typecheck.

> Build a publication site for a local coffee business. Read `AGENTS.md`, choose the required
> Karsa modules and tier, implement the smallest complete slice, and run typecheck and lint.

After upgrading `@karsa/core`, refresh the installed instructions with:

```sh
bunx karsa skills install
```

Karsa 0.3 applications import `@karsa/theme/styles.css` at the document boundary. Charts
are opt-in through `@karsa/charts/Chart.astro`; admin list pages use cursor URLs (`after` and
`before`) instead of numbered pagination.

## Common changes

- Change site name, locale, optional currency, palette, and copy in `astro.config.mjs`.
- Add or remove features with `bunx karsa add <module>` or
  `bunx karsa remove <module>`.
- Add site-specific starting data under `seed/`, then run `bunx karsa db seed`.
